// `axiomc test` CLI Subcommand Driver (`compiler/driver/test_cmd/mod.ax`, T818 / E19.5).
// Implements SPEC-104 §7.1 (AXS-TST-050, AXS-TST-053; REQ-TOOL-002..003,
// REQ-TOOL-005..011, REQ-TOOL-179, REQ-TST-112; INV-TST-001).
module compiler.driver.test_cmd

